    2. Build the 5x5 output canvas by placing 3 non-overlapping 4-connected sprites (sizes 2-9) on bg=8. Place them one at a time; for each, pick a random 4-connected polyomino shape, then choose a valid position with no overlap. Record each sprite's final cell coordinates.
